00:09:38,931 --> 00:09:41,152
warheads, were still on the island.

280
00:09:41,721 --> 00:09:44,262
The quarantine stayed in place until the

281
00:09:44,282 --> 00:09:46,567
Soviets agreed to remove their IL-28

282
00:09:46,587 --> 00:09:47,079
bombers.

283
00:09:47,419 --> 00:09:49,279
It ended on November 20.

284
00:09:49,619 --> 00:09:52,502
The Jupiter missiles left Turkey in April

285
00:09:52,522 --> 00:09:52,855
1963.

286
00:09:53,325 --> 00:09:55,473
And ten U-2 pilots of the Cuba flights

287
00:09:55,493 --> 00:09:57,584
were awarded the Distinguished Flying

288
00:09:57,604 --> 00:09:57,926
