293
00:10:05,930 --> 00:10:06,792
The Hotline.

294
00:10:07,362 --> 00:10:09,232
Every secret has a release date.

295
00:10:09,652 --> 00:10:12,762
The CIA's memo from October 16 was

296
00:10:12,782 --> 00:10:14,419
